# Pairs with AtomicOnOwner. The write gate does not refuse a sealed slot, so
# a router still holding the pre-split map prepares k2 on the split's source,
# where the owner's read never sees the bucket.
MODULE: AtomicOnOwnerFoldPrepareIgnoresSeal
TARGET: AtomicOnOwner
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a prepare through a stale map lands on a shard whose seal should refuse it
PERTURBS: SagaPrepare

--- FIND
       IN /\ ~Refused(s, k)
          /\ PrepareLandable(s, k)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the seal does not refuse the prepare.
       IN /\ PrepareLandable(s, k)
--- END
